  "description": "This beautiful city centre apartment has been recently renovated. It has an open plan living/kitchen area with sofa bed, and an excellent home office set up. The flooring throughout is a combination of quality oak laminate and porcelain tiles, complemented by a quartz kitchen worktop.\n\nThe apartment has a fully integrated kitchen with all appliances including hob, oven, microwave, fridge, dishwasher, washer/dryer. It is equipped with a number of high tech features including a Cat 6 computer network, and remote control motorised blinds. A high speed Internet connection, with digital TV and landline facility, is supplied by Virgin Media. \n\nThe corridor leads to a double bedroom with a floor to ceiling wardrobe, and a king size bed with Emma mattress. The fully tiled bathroom has a Triton T90st quiet electric shower.\n\nThere is an array of public transport within 5 minutes walk including the LUAS, Dublin Bus and Connolly Station (DART/Trains). There is a 747 shuttle bus connection to Dublin Airport within 1 minutes walk.\n\nThis prime location, which is close to the IFSC, benefits from numerous amenities and multinational corporations on its doorstep. It is 5 minutes walk to oConnell Street and there are numerous retail shops in close proximity. \n\nSecure covered car park space behind electronically controlled gates is available as an optional extra.",
